  <metadata>
    <name>Road Ride — 65 km</name>
    <desc>Sample track for gpxviewer.app — Cycling baseline with detectable climbs, heat-zones and heart-rate data. The route follows real public roads and paths in Rolling countryside near Lyon, generated with the BRouter engine over OpenStreetMap data; the timestamps are synthetic and there is no personal GPS recording. Route geometry © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL.</desc>
